CONTRIBUTORS ARE NOT LIABLE FOR DAMAGES, CLAIMS OR OTHER LIABILITY ARISING
FROM IT OR ITS USE, WHETHER IN CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE. MANDATORY RIGHTS
THAT CANNOT LAWFULLY BE EXCLUDED REMAIN UNAFFECTED.

9. Agreement authority

Contact the Licensor or an expressly authorized Licensing Maintainer recorded
in MAINTAINERS.md. Appointments and grants for application paywalls,
alternative licensing terms, proprietary exceptions, Branding Changes or
grant-back exceptions must be in writing. No response, repository access,
support payment, contribution or Plugin purchase implies such an exception.
Community modifications do not by themselves confer authority to grant
commercial or branding exceptions for the Application or other authors'
covered code. Changes to a maintainer list do not revoke executed licenses or
enlarge authority beyond the underlying appointment.
